PRO FORMA FIRST RESOLUTION OF THE GENERAL PARTNER

WHEREAS the formation of the Limited Partnership requires compliance with the Partnership Act (Alberta);

RESOLVED that the General Partner subscribes to the initial capital contribution of one dollar ($1.00);

RESOLVED that the registered office address of the Partnership shall be [Insert Full Street Address, City, Alberta, Canada];

RESOLVED that [Insert Name], the undersigned, be appointed as the General Partner of the Partnership and is empowered to sign all necessary filings and agreements;

RESOLVED that the Limited Partnership Agreement, a copy of which has been reviewed, be adopted as the internal governance document;

RESOLVED FURTHER that the General Partner is authorized to submit the Limited Partnership Registration Statement to the Alberta Corporate Registry and to undertake any ancillary steps required for the Partnership's establishment and operation.

Dated at [City], Alberta, this [Date].

[Signature]

[Printed Name]
